'''Qymish''' is a [[Sukatic languages|Sukatic language]] of the [[LANG FAMILY]]. It is the native language of the [[Qymish people]]. Standard Qymish is the official language of [[Qym]]. 

==Geographic distribution==
*{{flag|Qym}}: L1 139.8 million<!--139,798,903--> (86.36%), L2 22.07 million<!--22,073,598--> (13.64%)

*139,798,903 [[Meran]] L1
*22,073,598 [[Meran]] L2
*Total [[Meran]]: 161,872,501

*Elsewhere? TBD

